+02f06a3ae8a7cefb5ba8f5a5abaf94f2a91a661a1d5f1ade3e1b3f8c4ae02860.
+
+The complete twelve-path population is the source contract under
+docs/architecture/v0a-evaluation-r001/: two new stdlib tools, three new finite
+correctness suites, one literal fixture and six exact registration exceptions.
+Every incorporated path must equal its reviewed raw Git blob. The complete sorted
+manifest and raw payload copies are retained at
+D:/Pontius-handoffs/v0a-evaluation-source/r001/ and at
+D:/Pontius/tmp/v0a-evaluation-source-r001/packets/r001/.
+The inherited semantic base B remains e043f81ecec3ac16128720b42c3312bb41a4ed67.
+All paths outside the twelve-path source increment equal the adopted opening base.
+
+Canonical request bytes fix deal/lineup/seat order, alternating strategy order,
+all six positions, identical saved input for both arms, and six fresh 200-chip
+stacks per trial. Original physical cards remain fixed across seat rotations.
+The parent uses only the accepted seeded recipe and native host Job through three
+fixed admitted raw-buffer aliases; the unchanged public session owns poker actions,
+source admission, legal fallback, timing, host application and settlement.
+
+The wrapper creates the complete plan before play, retains intent before process
+creation and captures failures without retrying or starting later units. Native
+suspended creation, Job assignment before resume, bounded parallel stream capture
+and descendant cleanup preserve explicit unknown outcomes. Source and saved-input
+checks share the whole-run clock, including full trial plus cleanup reserve at
+admission. The exact unchanged child CLI and scrubbed environment remain bound.
+
+Strict versioned observation distinguishes baseline selections from host-applied
+actions and legacy choices. Valid incomplete observations remain unverified prefixes;
+action failure observations and propagated hand/session causes retain separate scopes.
+Unknown values remain null, and incomplete trials cannot supply a score. Aggregate
+arithmetic uses the full planned denominator with no survivor-only result.
+
+Final publication creates an exclusive pending guard before either final file.
+Actual write, flush, fsync, close, readback, source/input revalidation and the final
+shared-clock check precede irreversible commit. Only then may the writer attempt
+one empty-guard removal. Release failure does not revoke committed bytes. Consumers
+require absent guard and stable, schema-valid, hash-bound result/completion files;
+exit status, marker existence and prepared timestamps alone establish nothing.
+This provides no visibility-by-deadline or universal OS-blocking hard-wall claim.
+
