+## Retained development outcomes
+
+All original checkpoints, reports, RED/GREEN receipts, snapshots and partial roots
+remain retained. Two bounded substantive source FIX rounds were used. FIX01 moved
+cross-row conflict checks before prefix mutation. FIX02 validated captured native Git
+bytes before every Git launch and cleared scoring/completion flags after a later
+retention failure, while preserving the actual completed unit record and stopped
+prefix. Each correction has retained independent review and executable controls.
+Earlier NOT CLEAN outcomes remain unchanged; the final whole-source reviews cover
+the complete corrected candidate.
+
+Pre-review boundary iterations retained an insufficient non-deadline test-helper
+budget failure and an inventory refusal of inherited unittest classes. The finite
+helper allowance became 30,000 ms while exact deadline-edge controls kept their
+explicit clocks; boundary tests were flattened into direct TestCase classes without
+changing their bodies/oracles. The existing inventory analyzer remained unchanged.
+Earlier harness/setup refusals and deliberately failing controls remain distinct
+in the receipt index. No failed root was cleaned up, rerolled or relabeled successful.
+
+Permanent local coordination packets are preserved byte-exactly. During preparation,
+automatic approval review rejected the separate GitHub handoff upload, leaving its
+explicit authorization pending at metadata freeze. Local preservation is not a
+remote-upload claim; any later upload receives its own disposition. Retained evidence
+remains at its original D-local paths.
+
+## Metadata integration and next boundary
+
+Following the prior source-seal integration procedure, the metadata candidate
+requires one fresh independent Tier A light review, exact incorporation of all
+twelve source blobs and the unchanged status generator --check plus all twelve
+status tests on actual 3.11.15 first and then 3.14.6, in four fresh exact-candidate
+snapshots. The complete integration delta is exactly fourteen paths. These metadata
+checks replace no source review or source acceptance gate. The controller separately
+authorizes the exact decision commit; neither draft status nor local review refs
+claim adoption.
+
+The next step is a separately preregistered population: seed, distinct lineups,
+size, resource budgets, metrics, stopping/retention and interpretation must be fixed
+prospectively. An exact invocation then needs its own authority. No comparative
+evaluation, tuning, neural loading, training, self-play, league, new opponents,
+human play, operating/research claim, cleanup, export or ref retirement follows
+from this source seal. Earlier demonstration owners remain consumed and closed.
+The research/operating prerequisites and ADR-0307 runtime contract remain binding.
